toggleMusicSound...
toggleSfxSound...
```
Need set open state. Ensure if already open.
```
openAudioSettings() {
 if (!this.audioOverlay.hidden) return;
 this.audioPanelReturn = {state:this.state, overlayHidden:this.overlay.hidden};
 if(this.state==='play') this.state='pause';
 this.overlay.hidden=true;
